---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Guides | agediscriminationcalc.com';
const description = 'In-depth guides covering key topics at agediscriminationcalc.com.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>Guides</h1>
  <p>Plain-language guides written and reviewed by our editorial team.</p>
  <h3><a href="/guides/how-adea-damages-work">How ADEA Damages Work</a></h3>
  <p>Back pay, liquidated damages doubling, front pay, mitigation, and attorney fees under the Age Discrimination in Employment Act.</p>
  <h3><a href="/guides/types-of-age-discrimination">Types of Age Discrimination</a></h3>
  <p>Disparate treatment, disparate impact, harassment, retaliation, and the but-for causation standard.</p>
  <h3><a href="/guides/what-to-do-after-age-discrimination">What to Do After Age Discrimination</a></h3>
  <p>Documentation, EEOC filing, deadlines, and finding employment counsel after an ADEA violation.</p>
  <h3><a href="/guides/common-adea-misconceptions">Common ADEA Misconceptions</a></h3>
  <p>Ten common misunderstandings about age discrimination claims, the willfulness standard, damages, and EEOC procedure.</p>
  <ul style="margin-top:2rem">
    <li><a href="/case-types">Case types overview</a></li>
    <li><a href="/methodology">Calculator methodology</a></li>
  </ul>
